<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 5.38 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 5.38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 5.38 percent on Wednesday from 4.67 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said seven banks traded on the market in 19 reported transactions with a total value of 22.3 million dinars ($31.5 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
